  "$schema": "../../schema/incident.schema.json",
  "protocol": "TMX Tribe",
  "name": "TMX Tribe Router-minted USDG inflates TLP AUM",
  "summary": "TMX, a GMX-v1 fork, made its public Router a Vault manager, so anyone could mint USDG via Router.swap. GlpManager values TLP as pool AUM over TLP supply without subtracting that USDG, so each mint raised the TLP price. The attacker looped mintAndStakeGlp, a Router USDG mint, redeeming TLP at the inflated price and selling the USDG back.",
