  "notes": [
    "ProxyAdmin upgrade selected Vault implementation 0x7f68594c, whose buyUSDG admitted the Router-manager mint. isManager(Router)=true (Timelock tx 0x830d8cb8, block 394937076), the Router implementation (block 395320426) and GlpManager all predate it, so it sets the age.",
    "Campaign: every successful Router.swap, mintAndStakeGlp and unstakeAndRedeem tx by the attacker EOAs 0x16ed3aff (Jan 3-4 tests) and 0x763a67e4 (main loop) after the anchor, through block 418024535.",
    "Loss is the Vault's net ERC-20 outflow to both EOAs across the campaign, so the attacker's loop capital is netted (rule 14); USDG nets to zero. DefiLlama prices at the last Vault-touching tx; unverified implementations, attribution rests on traces and storage."
